WEBVTT

s1-approve-publish
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:10.470
The Owner approves the event result and publishes it. The Viewer sees the official published result — v1 at 108 strokes.

s2-reopen-correct
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:27.920
The Owner reopens the result with a recorded reason, corrects one stroke from 3 to 5, and approves v2 at 110 without replaying all 18 holes. The correction reason stays visible in history.

s3-viewer-mid-correction
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:42.440
Before v2 is published, the Viewer still sees v1 at 108 as the official result while v2 sits in review, labeled as awaiting publication.

s4-publish-v2
00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:56.440
The Owner publishes v2, and the Viewer now sees the corrected official result — v2 at 110 — while v1 remains preserved in version history.
